name=TPMS Mod
id=LAWLYPOPS_TPMSINDICATOR
description=A tire pressure monitoring system (TPMS) for vehicles.
description=[h1] Tire Pressure Monitoring System [/h1]
description="The first passenger vehicle to adopt TPM was the Porsche 959 in 1986, using a hollow spoke wheel system developed by PSK... In the United States, TPM was introduced by General Motors for the 1991 model year for the Corvette..." [url=https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tire-pressure_monitoring_system] TPMS Wikipedia [/url]
description=[hr][/hr]
description=[h2] What is this? [/h2]
description=This mod adds a little indicator on your dashboard that shows if your tires are low.
description=[list]
description=[*]A solid amber light means a tire is [b]< 90%[/b] filled.
description=[*]If the light is blinking, then a tire is [b]< 50%[/b] filled.
description=[*]These thresholds can be adjusted in [b]sandbox settings[/b].
description=[/list]
description=
description=You may select "All", "Luxury", or "Custom" vehicles that have a TPMS installed (Default is all).
description=Custom will allow you to create your own semicolon-separated list of vehicles that have a TPMS.
description=
description=[b]Please view the FAQ discussion thread if you have a possibly already-answered question.[/b]
description=
description=Please enjoy this silly little mod :3
